@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false

rectangle "Camera Frame" as Frame
rectangle "Pose / Movement Telemetry" as Telemetry
rectangle "Tracking / Calibration Debug Events" as Tracking
rectangle "Rep Metrics" as Metrics
rectangle "FormEvent + FormEvidence[]" as Events
rectangle "CueDelivery\nactual feedback only" as CueDelivery
rectangle "CompactRepTrace\n+ generic TraceChannel[]" as CompactTrace
rectangle "Daily Nutrition Context" as Nutrition
rectangle "DailyHealthSummary" as DailyHealth
rectangle "WeeklyBodyComposition" as Weekly
rectangle "Health Connect Fine-grained Records\nprocessing input only" as Health
rectangle "Health Aggregator\nin-memory" as HealthAgg
rectangle "Debug Video\nopt-in only" as Video
queue "Telemetry Ring Buffer" as TelemetryQ
queue "Durable Event Queue" as DurableQ
rectangle "Batch Writer" as Writer
rectangle "Retention Worker\nstartup + periodic" as Retention
database "Room / SQLite" as Room
rectangle "App-private no-backup storage" as Files

Frame --> Telemetry : infer pose
Frame --> Video : explicit debug mode only
Frame --> Frame : discard immediately
Telemetry --> TelemetryQ : best-effort short-lived samples
Tracking --> TelemetryQ : short-lived debug events
Metrics --> DurableQ : long-term derived metrics
Events --> DurableQ : structured long-term rule evidence
CueDelivery --> DurableQ : long-term actual feedback record
CompactTrace --> DurableQ : long-term generic compact trace
DurableQ --> Writer : priority batches
TelemetryQ --> Writer : best-effort batches
Writer --> Room

Nutrition --> Room : long-term compact daily context
Health --> HealthAgg : normalize / aggregate
HealthAgg --> DailyHealth : daily compact summary
HealthAgg --> Weekly : weekly medians + counts
DailyHealth --> Room : long-term
Weekly --> Room : long-term
HealthAgg --> HealthAgg : discard fine-grained inputs
Video --> Files : <= 7 days
Retention --> Room : prune sets whose telemetryExpiresAt passed
Retention --> Files : delete expired debug media

note right of Telemetry
High-frequency movement telemetry is a short-term
full-fidelity debug/re-analysis window only.
ExerciseSet.telemetryExpiresAt is the purge anchor.
end note

note right of Events
FormEvent records a detected issue.
FormEvidence[] stores structured observed/threshold facts.
Do not use one opaque evidence JSON blob as the source of truth.
end note

note right of CueDelivery
CueDelivery records only feedback actually shown/spoken.
Suppressed FormEvents have no CueDelivery.
end note

note right of CompactTrace
Retain a small generic standardized trace long-term.
Use schemaId + typed channels so every exercise can define
its own compact signals without press-specific fields.
end note

note right of Video
OFF by default.
App-private/no-backup storage only.
MVP provides no personal-data export/share feature.
end note

note bottom of Retention
Run cleanup on app startup and periodically.
Expired data is ineligible for normal reads at telemetryExpiresAt;
physical purge follows through local cleanup jobs.
end note

note bottom of Room
Real personal data stays on-device only.
Android cloud backup must be disabled.
No automatic or user-facing personal-data export in MVP.
end note

@enduml
